{"id":"wyr_0341","option_a":"Be able to breathe in space","option_b":"Be able to survive without food or water indefinitely","category":"biology","hook":"Space breathing or biological independence?","debate_note":"Breathing in space opens the entire universe; surviving without sustenance eliminates one of life's biggest burdens."},
